# Redirects applied by Cloudflare Workers Static Assets before any file is served.
#
# The blog lived at /blog until the Codex redesign moved it to /writing. Its RSS
# feed was syndicated to LinkedIn, dev.to and Medium, so old post links are still
# out there. The old pages/blog redirect pages could not run on the static build.
/blog/rss.xml /rss.xml 301
/blog /writing 301
/blog/* /writing/:splat 301
